      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然白仁还小，但看我那样也还是有所顾虑吧。\n某天白仁邀我去赛跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12d5b42f94bd840e628e2309b4ca859e377c9b91dad12302e27dcfc402539afe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
